{"id": "heidelberg-2026-11-04-028", "date": "2026-11-04", "time_tags": {"year": 2026, "quarter": "Q4", "month": 11, "week": 45, "weekday": "Wed"}, "entities": {"companies": ["heidelberg"], "customers": [], "suppliers": []}, "topics": ["earnings"], "sentiment": {"label": "positive", "score": 0.75, "keywords": ["record", "increase"]}, "importance": {"score": 0.9, "reasons": ["涉及財報", "情緒極端"]}, "title": "Heidelberg Materials increases earnings by 9%", "content": "<p><img src=\"https://www.globalcement.com/images/news/results-financial-report.jpg\" /></p><p><strong>Germany: </strong>Heidelberg Materials announced its results for the first three quarters which ended on 30 September 2026. Revenue was recorded as €6.4bn, up by 10% year-on-year compared to the €5.8bn recorded in the corresponding period of 2025. Results from current operations rose to €1.3bn, up by 9% from €1.2bn in the same period of 2025.</p>\n<p>The Transformation Accelerator Initiative annou", "sources": [{"name": "global_cement", "url": "https://www.globalcement.com/news/21448-heidelberg-materials-increases-earnings-by-9", "type": "rss"}]}
{"id": "holcim-2026-11-04-029", "date": "2026-11-04", "time_tags": {"year": 2026, "quarter": "Q4", "month": 11, "week": 45, "weekday": "Wed"}, "entities": {"companies": ["holcim"], "customers": [], "suppliers": []}, "topics": ["carbon_emissions", "capacity"], "sentiment": {"label": "neutral", "score": 0.0, "keywords": []}, "importance": {"score": 0.65, "reasons": ["涉及產能"]}, "title": "Holcim invests in 44.01 to advance carbon mineralisation storage", "content": "<p><img src=\"https://www.globalcement.com/images/news/HOLCIM_2021_7D_146-1500.jpg\" /></p><p><strong>Oman: </strong>Holcim has invested in 44.01, a developer of mineralisation technology where captured CO₂ is injected into naturally reactive ultramafic rock formations, and mineralised into stable carbonate rock. The investment, announced on 4 November 2026, will support 44.01's international expansion and marks the next step in an established commercial relationship between Holcim and 44.01.</p>\n", "sources": [{"name": "global_cement", "url": "https://www.globalcement.com/news/21446-holcim-invests-in-44-01-to-advance-carbon-mineralisation-storage", "type": "rss"}]}
